# Removed from the repo at the owner's request (history rewritten in the same
# change). CI runs `npm test`, so a clone without test/ cannot run the suite —
# keep a local copy.
test/
docs/
design/

# Internal planning and spec documents. README.md, CHANGELOG.md and the
# package READMEs stay tracked: the root README and CHANGELOG are what the npm
# page and release notes link to, and packages/desktop/README.md is listed in
# that package's `files`, so ignoring it would blank its registry page.
*.md
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!packages/desktop/README.md
